# Applies to <app>/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The build context is
# the repository root, so paths are from the root: only this app and shared/ are sent.
*
!gate
!shared
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/backend/data
**/backend/bin
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
